  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She appears to console Three Feather Boy and names herself Cui Bo. Fang Yuan assesses her as Fairy Cui Bo, emanating rank seven aura and treating herself as his equal. With Three Feather Boy she is a strong duo that schemed Fiend Mosquito into a Gu formation while she waited in ambush. She is Thousand Transformations Ancestor’s third concubine, one of nearly ten Gu Immortal wives and concubines of that Western Desert lone immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        1394
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_western_desert"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a small and dainty body like a little girl in a flowery green dress, with two pearl earrings that seem to hold water and show green ripples when they shake. Her skin is white as snow, the green rippling light from the earrings makes her look eerie, her face is delicate, and her nose is slightly sharp, ruining her image.",
      "chapters": [
        1394
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s giant hand killer move forces her back; she answers with green acid that corrodes part of the hand and calls out her status under Thousand Transformations Ancestor, offering alliance over the treasure. Fang Yuan sends Bai Ning Bing, Hei Lou Lan, and Fairy Miao Yin after the pair. Bai Ning Bing later returns with Fairy Cui Bo frozen as a captive. Fang Yuan keeps her alive for now, both because annexing her aperture is poorly timed and because her link to a rank eight can blunt heaven’s will’s schemes, and he has Bai Ning Bing store her.",
      "chapters": [
        1394
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clash-and-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_fairy_miao_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Using change soul Immortal Gu, Fang Yuan switches Ying Wu Xie’s soul with Fairy Cui Bo’s soul; Ying Wu Xie’s soul takes over her body while her own soul is suppressed and stuffed into Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal aperture. He considers refining her rank seven soul into a soul beast using a method from Purple Mountain True Monarch’s inheritance, since it would let him command her with absolute loyalty without enslavement path methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1397
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-switched-with-ying-wu-xie",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_change_soul_immortal_gu",
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
      ]
    }
  ],
